      "id": 8380674310326,
      "title": "Nike Women's Air Max 95 OG Black / Pink Foam - White",
      "handle": "nike-womens-air-max-95-og-black-pink-foam-white",
      "body_html": "<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Layered textile and synthetic leather upper for durability and dimension</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Visible Max Air units in heel and forefoot deliver lightweight, responsive cushioning</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Wavy side panels nod to the shoe’s anatomy-inspired design</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Foam midsole with flex grooves ensures smooth movement</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Rubber outsole provides durable traction and grip</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Padded collar and tongue for all-day comfort</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Nike Women's Air Max 95 OG in Black, Pink Foam and White brings bold energy to a legendary silhouette. With its muscle-inspired design lines, soft cushioning, and street-ready attitude, this iconic sneaker keeps your rotation fresh while honouring its ‘90s running roots.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Product Code: </span><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-97f4c18e-7fff-55a7-7c6c-5771203d602a\"></b>HJ5996-001</p>",
