    {
      "id": 8366098710710,
      "title": "Salomon XT-Pathway GTX Lunar Rock / Alloy",
      "handle": "salomon-xt-pathway-gtx-lunar-rock-alloy",
      "body_html": "<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>GORE-TEX membrane delivers waterproof protection and breathability</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Mud Contagrip® outsole with chevron lugs offers enhanced traction on rugged terrain</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Agile Chassis System provides stability and cushioning</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>SensiFIT™ construction and lace pocket for a secure, comfortable fit</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>OrthoLite® insole adds long-lasting cushioning and breathability</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Salomon XT-Pathway GTX in Lunar Rock and Alloy blends trail-ready innovation with winter weather protection. Designed with a waterproof GORE-TEX membrane, rugged outsole, and stabilizing chassis, it’s built for comfort and performance across any terrain.</span></p>\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-554d7f36-7fff-c28d-44d4-375c4832ba2b\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-3daf1b3b-7fff-d259-17d2-dbc8caf9baf0\"></b></b>Product Code: L47730900</p>",
