      "id": 8335468986550,
      "title": "Sonneti London T-Shirt / Alaskan Blue",
      "handle": "sonneti-london-t-shirt-alaskan-blue",
      "body_html": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"54\">Minimal Sonneti logo at the front for a clean look</li>\n<li data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"94\">Classic crew neck for everyday wear</li>\n<li data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"129\">Soft, comfortable construction</li>\n<li data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"158\">Easy, relaxed silhouette<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"416\">The Sonneti London T-Shirt in Alaskan Blue keeps things simple and sharp with its minimal branding and clean crew-neck design. Soft and easy to wear, it’s the perfect everyday staple, fresh, versatile, and ready for any casual fit.</p>\n<p data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"446\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Product code: SNTTM13197O386</p>",
